  "title": "LFP during linear track in 6-month old TgF344-AD rats",
  "description": "Local field potential (LFP) recordings collected from TgF344-AD rats, a transgenic model of Alzheimer's disease, at 6 months of age while the animals traversed a linear track. The dataset is organized in BIDS format and supports investigation of hippocampal network activity in early-stage Alzheimer's disease pathology.",
  "methods_description": "Local field potential (LFP) recordings were obtained from 6-month-old TgF344-AD rats during linear track navigation tasks using intracranial electrodes. Recordings targeted hippocampal and prefrontal cortical regions.",
